                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The easement\npermits city\nworkers to cross\nthe service hall\nfor pipe repairs.",
                                  "It does not grant\npublic use of\nbedrooms or\nkitchen. The lodge\nowner keeps those",
                                  "rooms. Nib reads\nthe boundary\naloud, unusually\nfree of theatrical\ngestures."
                                ],
